ch.<br></li><li><strong>Optional Souls-like Boss Encounters</strong><br>Challenge the Symbols of the World. Confront your adversary in tense arena duels that requires consistent timing and execution.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548880/extras/2e1f3400a51ea5eea12778f1434ffec5.poster.avif?t=1722115744\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548880/extras/2e1f3400a51ea5eea12778f1434ffec5.webm?t=1722115744\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548880/extras/2e1f3400a51ea5eea12778f1434ffec5.mp4?t=1722115744\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
